<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Utusan 6-mth net rises sharply.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Utusan 6-mth net rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  21.89   vs	   4.06</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 28.3    vs	   5.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		   132.05   vs	 125.93</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    24.47   vs	   9.29</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.85   vs  less   0.99</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia Utusan Melayu (Malaysia) Bhd is involved in the publication and distribution of newspapers and magazines.</p>
